  "query_preview": "/SATURDAY NIGHT THROUGH THURSDAY/...\nIssued at 252 PM CDT Thu Aug 13 2026\n\nThe ring of fire pattern continues through Saturday night. PWATs \nover 2\" linger until a cold front sweeps through Sunday morning. \nGEFS/EPS guidance highlights Saturday into Sunday morning as another \nperiod of storm chances, with similar potential for marginal severe \nchances and flash flooding as we have seen most of this week. High \npressure and drier canadian air may bring a brief break from any \nrain chances before the ridge breaks down a bit and shortwaves and \nenhanced flow return to our part of Midwest by midweek. This will \nneed to be monitored for renewed severe weather and heavy rain \nconcerns.",
